          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "The Supreme Court declined to hear the challenge to Maryland's \"sensitive places\" carry restrictions, leaving the Fourth Circuit's ruling in place.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "On today's order list the Court turned away Novotny v. Moore (No. 25-1324). Maryland's limits at campuses, hospitals, parks, transit and venues serving alcohol stay in force; a denial is not a ruling on the merits.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "color": "Warning",
